-- Live boss and trash abilities our old-dungeon creatures never cast (data farm 19 Nov, BOSS-SPELLS.md: EG Link combat logs from the live
-- realm, builds 70205-70959, CC BY 4.0, https://efficient.games). Each spell below was seen cast by that creature on live, and no
-- smart_scripts row or C++ script of ours casts it. The biggest gap: Mutanus the Devourer (Wailing Caverns) cast nothing at all;
-- his VMaNGOS spell list (Naralex's Nightmare, Terrify, Thundercrack) was never converted because he already had other rows.
-- Timers: VMaNGOS creature_spells where VMaNGOS has the spell (Mutanus), otherwise INFERRED from how often live casts it.
-- Commander Springvale: live shields himself with Divine Shield (642), ours used Divine Protection (498) on the same 25% row.
-- Left out on purpose: spells our C++ bosses cast under another id (Herod, Noxxion, Thermaplugg's bombs), Mograine's Lay on Hands
-- (tied into the Whitemane resurrection chain), friendly NPCs and cosmetic or script-driven casts (Ashcrombe, Arugal, Uldaman).
-- Rows use ids 100+ with an 'EG live' comment. A row is only added when nothing else of the creature already casts that spell,
-- so a database that has it from elsewhere does not cast it twice. Safe to run again.

UPDATE `creature_template` SET `AIName` = 'SmartAI' WHERE `entry` IN (3654,3669,4278,4291,4292,4535,4805,4809,4814,4818,5048,6047,6211,6243,7351,8127,11791,12876) AND `AIName` = '' AND `ScriptName` = '';
DELETE FROM `smart_scripts` WHERE `source_type` = 0 AND `entryorguid` IN (3654,3669,4278,4291,4292,4535,4805,4809,4814,4818,5048,6047,6211,6243,7351,8127,11791,12876) AND `id` >= 100 AND `comment` LIKE 'EG live%';
UPDATE `smart_scripts` SET `action_param1` = 642, `comment` = 'EG live: Commander Springvale - below 25% health - Divine Shield (was Divine Protection 498)' WHERE `entryorguid` = 4278 AND `source_type` = 0 AND `action_type` = 11 AND `action_param1` = 498;
